This folder is Halonic's runtime slot.

Halonic Studio puts the runtime (Node, engine, agent host and srt, pinned
together) in /opt/halonic/<version> and points /opt/halonic/current at it,
keeping the version before as /opt/halonic/previous. The updater,
/usr/local/sbin/halonic-runtime, does this as root from Windows; the image
ships the folder empty. Everything here is root's: don't change it by hand.
